NAL\",\"SECRET_LIST\",\"MODULE_MANAGE\",\"COMPONENT_DEPLOY\",\"SERVICE_QUERY\",\"COMPONENT_UPDATE\",\"NODE_DETECTION\"],\"restartCount\":null,\"runningPeriod\":10379815678,\"schedule\":null,\"selector\":null,\"serviceDns\":null,\"serviceEndPoints\":null,\"serviceType\":null,\"size\":0,\"status\":null,\"storages\":null,\"suspend\":null,\"terminal\":\"enabled\",\"type\":null,\"updateTime\":null,\"version\":null,\"volumes\":null,\"yaml\":null},{\"activeAmount\":null,\"activeJobs\":null,\"actualCpu\":null,\"actualMemory\":null,\"annotations\":{\"kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration\":\"{\\\"apiVersion\\\":\\\"v1\\\",\\\"data\\\":{\\\"arch\\\":\\\"amd64,arm64\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"## Patch description\\\\n  calico component patch package\\\\n\\\\n## Usage restrictions\\\\n  None\\\\n\\\\n## Update content\\\\n  1.0.0\\\\n  1、calico upgrade 3.21.6\\\\n  2、calico service probe timeout optimisation, timeoutSeconds:10\\\\n\\\\n  1.1.0\\\\n  1. Upgrade calico to version 3.25.0.\\\\n  2. Adapt the component cluster nodes for multiple architectures (arm, x86).\\\\n  3. fix calico's inability to produce blockhole blackhole routes, affecting static IP service communication, upgrade calico to 3.25.0\\\\n  4. fix the service pend error rpc error:xxx connection is unauthorised:Unauthorized version defect, upgrade calico to 3.25.0.\\\\n  5. Fix calico can not adapt to different aliases of the network card node component cluster, calico-node.yaml adjustments\\\\n  - name:IP_AUTODETECTION_METHOD\\\\n    value:\\\\\\\"can-reach=master01\\\\\\\"\\\\n  6. fixed IP assignment conflict issue, upgraded calico to 3.25.0\\\\n\\\\n  1.1.1\\\\n  3. modified cidr=XX.XX.XX.XX.XX/24 -\\\\u003e can-se=can-reach, calico-node.yaml adjustment\\\\n  - name:IP_AUTODETECTION_METHOD\\\\n    value:\\\\\\\"can-reach=master01\\\\\\\"\\\\n  4. calico-kube-controllers metrics port open, calico-kube-controllers add configuration\\\\n  template.\\\\n    metadata.\\\\n      annotations.\\\\n     